CORE
undriven_read_twice1.sv
--bound 1 --aig
^\[main\.p0\] always main\.a != main\.b: PROVED up to bound 1$
^\[main\.p1\] always main\.a == main\.w: PROVED up to bound 1$
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
A wire without a driver that is read more than once must yield the same
value for every read.
